# Backend-local overrides for Railway upload (root .gitignore excludes `data/`
# which removes our gemeente_provincie_map fixture during `railway up`). The
# negation below restores it when railway re-anchors paths under `./backend`.
!app/data/
!app/data/*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
tests/__pycache__/
